> what is the capital of France?
<! reports it as
> 17 + 25
<! reports it as
> who wrote Hamlet?
<! reports it as
> is a whale a mammal?
<! reports it as
> translate "good morning" to italian
<! reports it as
> was it observed that DART slowed the orbital period?
