!set PARROT0_BASE=kb/core/base.p0
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_WORLD_FACTS=1
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test sc2c attivo e passivo convergono su un solo frame]
!timeout 90
> slowed is a relation verb
< Learned: relation_verb(slowed).
> "the measurements indicate that" is an observation report marker.
< Learned: observation_report_marker("the measurements indicate that").
# Solo la forma ATTIVA viene letta.
> read: https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804 The measurements indicate that DART slowed the orbital period.
<~ 1 proposition(s) normalized in quarantine
!query claim_frame(document_0246e706600fd069_5d809f6f7baf11bd_unit_0_claim_0, slowed, dart, orbital_period)
# La domanda in forma PASSIVA trova la stessa proposizione.
> was it observed that the orbital period was slowed by DART?
< Yes - that claim is reported as observed (from https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804).
> was it hypothesized that the orbital period was slowed by DART?
< No - that claim is reported as observed, not hypothesized.
# E la forma PASSIVA nel testo produce lo stesso frame della forma attiva.
> read: https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804 The measurements indicate that the orbital period was slowed by DART.
<~ 1 proposition(s) normalized in quarantine
!query claim_frame(document_0246e706600fd069_67f8bf2d6e2cffe5_unit_0_claim_0, slowed, dart, orbital_period)
# CONTRASTO: il passivo non rovescia i ruoli.
!query! claim_frame(document_0246e706600fd069_67f8bf2d6e2cffe5_unit_0_claim_0, slowed, orbital_period, dart)
> was it observed that DART slowed the orbital period?
< Yes - that claim is reported as observed (from https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804).
# E nessuna delle due forme entra nel mondo.
!query! slowed(dart, orbital_period)
!query! slowed(orbital_period, dart)

[test sc2c la prova si pronuncia]
!timeout 60
> what did the measurements indicate?
<~ The source reports it as observed
> how do you know?
<~ «the measurements indicate that» marks it as observed
> was it observed that DART slowed the orbital period?
< Yes - that claim is reported as observed (from https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804).
> how do you know?
<~ https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804
!query claim_live_cue(document_0246e706600fd069_67f8bf2d6e2cffe5_unit_0_claim_0, "the measurements indicate that")

[test sc2c il residuo non letto dice contro che cosa si e' fermato]
!timeout 90
> "the investigators predict that" is a hypothesis report marker.
< Learned: hypothesis_report_marker("the investigators predict that").
# MODALITA': «can» non e' un verbo mancante, e' un operatore che il lettore non
# sa ancora comporre. Dirlo e' diverso da tacere.
> read: https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804 The investigators predict that a kinetic impactor can shorten an asteroid orbit.
<~ Mapped 1 document unit(s), 1 reported claim(s), and 1 live epistemic status(es)
!query claim_normalization_gap(document_0246e706600fd069_d3b49d23827748fa_unit_0_claim_0, modal_operator)
!query! claim_normalized(document_0246e706600fd069_d3b49d23827748fa_unit_0_claim_0, reported)
!query claim_surface(document_0246e706600fd069_d3b49d23827748fa_unit_0_claim_0, "a kinetic impactor can shorten an asteroid orbit")
